— a closure into a Public Suffix List, used to validate that","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"the relying-party identifier is a registrable suffix of the origin’s effective","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"domain.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"code":"enterpriseRpIds","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" — relying-party identifiers allowed to receive"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"platform-managed enterprise attestation. When the request specifies"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/yubikit-swift.YubiKit\/documentation\/YubiKit\/WebAuthn\/AttestationPreference\/enterprise","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":", the client escalates to level 2"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"(platform-managed) for RPs in this set, and uses level 1 (vendor-facilitated)"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"otherwise."}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"allowedExtensions"},{"type":"text","text":" — the set of WebAuthn extensions the client will process."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Anything the relying party requests outside this set is dropped before reaching"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"the authenticator. Defaults to "},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/yubikit-swift.YubiKit\/documentation\/YubiKit\/WebAuthn\/Extension"},{"type":"text","text":"’s standard set."}]}]}],"type":"unorderedList"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"PIN and user verification are supplied per ceremony via ","type":"text"},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/yubikit-swift.YubiKit\/documentation\/YubiKit\/WebAuthn\/Authorization"},{"text":",","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"out-of-band from the ceremony stream. Both ceremony methods return a","type":"text"},{"text":" ","